# Git stores text with LF and checks it out with LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored trees and generated files are exempt from language statistics and
# collapse in diffs; extend the list when one lands
# (.claude/rules/vendored-inputs.md, .claude/rules/codegen.md).
docs/specs/** linguist-vendored -text
website/book/vendor/** linguist-vendored -text
# Rendered and derived by scripts/conformance/matrix.sh (docs/architecture.md
# section 12); the conformance-matrix guard fails when either is stale.
website/book/src/evaluate/conformance.md linguist-generated
conformance/requirements.tsv linguist-generated
